[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3097011426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3097011426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3097011426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64mKTi","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T14:25:44Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T01:16:09Z","body":"Hi @Monday-nr,\n\nThanks for your detailed description and example project — I’ve looked into the issue and I can confirm the behavior you're describing.\n\n✅ Confirmed behavior:\nAnimations named with the -loop suffix (e.g., Run-loop) are:\n\n✅ Set to loop when the .glb is opened as a scene.\n\n❌ Not marked to loop in the import settings panel.\n\nAfter setting an animation save path and reimporting:\n\nThe loop setting is not preserved.\n\nThe suffix-based behavior appears to be discarded during reimport.\n\nThe saved .anim files contain no loop metadata unless manually adjusted afterward.\n\n🧩 Likely cause:\nIt seems that:\n\nThe -loop suffix is only interpreted during the scene generation phase,\n\nBut not saved into the import metadata (e.g., .import or .anim files),\n\nTherefore, it’s lost during reimport, especially when animation save paths are enabled.\n\n💡 Suggestion:\nThe import system should:\n\nDetect and respect suffix-based settings (-loop, etc.) even when exporting animations as separate resources,\n\nOr at the very least, reflect this setting in the import UI, so it’s not silently lost.\n\nLet me know if you'd like help testing a patch or workaround — happy to assist!\n\nBest regards,","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3097011426/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105303096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3105303096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3105303096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65Fyo4","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T01:14:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T01:14:21Z","body":"There are two different systems for Godot Engine 4.5~\n\n1. \"-loop\" suffix system which is older\n2. advanced importer system which is newer\n\nThey only overlap but do not integrate with each other. \n\nWhat is your expected behaviour?\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105303096/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105305465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3105305465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3105305465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65FzN5","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T01:15:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T01:16:58Z","body":"@Storm-Dev6 I have hidden your answer because you seemed to have guessed that we are hard editing the cache files in .godot engine.. rather than two different systems not working together.\n\n1. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/import_configuration.html\n2. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/node_type_customization.html#doc-importing-3d-scenes-node-type-customization","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105305465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105608038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3105608038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3105608038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65G9Fm","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T04:07:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T04:07:32Z","body":"Hmm... really? \n\nand why has been added this if i just \"seemed\" : ```GDScriptet```\n\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nfunc _run():\n    var dir = DirAccess.open(\"res://animations\")\n    for file in dir.get_files():\n        if file.ends_with(\".anim\"):\n            var anim = ResourceLoader.load(\"res://animations/\" + file)\n            if anim is Animation:\n                anim.loop = true\n                ResourceSaver.save(\"res://animations/\" + file, anim)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105608038/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105611528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3105611528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3105611528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65G98I","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T04:09:16Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T04:09:16Z","body":"But if you didnt trust me just dont change the ```.glb``` import 😄 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105611528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105836557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3105836557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3105836557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65H04N","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T05:52:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T05:52:36Z","body":"<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1380\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51f10216-d1e0-4317-a3c6-9f6ba39acbbe\" />\n\nThe loop isn't activate in the sample","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3105836557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106220888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3106220888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3106220888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65JStY","user":{"login":"Monday-nr","id":122647233,"node_id":"U_kgDOB09ywQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122647233?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr","html_url":"https://github.com/Monday-nr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Monday-nr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T07:20:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T07:32:16Z","body":"@fire Well, my expected behaviour is that the loop mode in the importer would be set to 'linear' automatically, if I add the \"loop\" suffix to the animation's name. @Calinou told me to open a bug report about this after I commented about it on this page in the docs:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/node_type_customization.html\n\nIf the loop suffix is not supposed to work with the importer then this issue can be closed I guess. Though I think it should be made clear in the docs. (And it would be great if the suffixes would work with the newer importer too, down the line.)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3106220888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109600695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3109600695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3109600695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65WL23","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T18:04:47Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T18:04:58Z","body":"We would need to make a Godot Engine improvement proposal for loop mode in the importer to be set to 'linear' automatically, if one adds the \"loop\" suffix to the animation's name. Help welcome.\n\nThen worry about backwards incompatibility.\n\nAs a bug, I think loop mode in import hints and animation advanced importer being two system is designed as intended.\n\nI agree the usability is janky and could be better.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109600695/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234711054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-3234711054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":3234711054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AzcYO","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T19:34:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T19:34:58Z","body":"I would like this to be solved with a glTF extension for specifying animation loop modes. Then, in addition to the extension data, as a Godot-specific hack, the `-loop` suffix can be read by the glTF importer and used to set the same internal variable used by the extension data, so it can be imported as a looped animation with the same internal code. The existence of the extension would also allow us to explicitly mark animations as looping on export without renaming it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234711054/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4847299357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823#issuecomment-4847299357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108823","id":4847299357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIOvrHQ","user":{"login":"DissonantVoid","id":69814029,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5ODE0MDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69814029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid","html_url":"https://github.com/DissonantVoid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DissonantVoid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T19:39:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T20:15:02Z","body":"Still valid as of 4.7. Is there no work around other than manually assigning loop mode?\n\nEdit: Since I'm using EditorScenePostImportPlugin to automate imports I figured one solution is to manually write animations to file. This works but feels like reinventing the wheel\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorScenePostImportPlugin\n\n...\n\nfunc _pre_process(scene: Node):\n\t_save_animations(scene)\n\n# -loop suffix is broken when save_to_file is turned on in import settings so I have to save manually\n# https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108823\nfunc _save_animations(node: Node):\n\tif node is AnimationPlayer:\n\t\tfor lib_name: StringName in node.get_animation_library_list():\n\t\t\tvar lib: AnimationLibrary = node.get_animation_library(lib_name)\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tfor anim_name: StringName in lib.get_animation_list():\n\t\t\t\tvar anim: Animation = lib.get_animation(anim_name)\n\t\t\t\tvar anim_path: String = _source_file.get_basename() + \"_\" + anim_name + \".res\"\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tvar existing_settings = get_option_value(\"_subresources\")[\"animations\"].get(anim_name, {})\n\t\t\t\tif existing_settings[\"save_to_file/enabled\"]:\n\t\t\t\t\tpush_error(\"disable save_to_file for animation: \", anim_name) \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t# save manually\n\t\t\t\tResourceSaver.save(anim, anim_path)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t# update reference\n\t\t\t\tlib.add_animation(anim_name, load(anim_path))\n\t\n\tfor child in node.get_children():\n\t\t_save_animations(child)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4847299357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]